  <Intro>k__BackingField: The crusade has come. Two armies march on the coven's town, and the nights grow long. Hold the walls for four weeks, until the winter breaks them for you.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The snow takes what you left of them. The crusade breaks against your walls, and the roads home are long.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Hold out for four weeks.
  <Loss>k__BackingField: Your town must not fall.
